    <string name="daily_wallpaper_list_hint">Where the daily wallpaper (Settings → Daily wallpaper) comes from. The Inilauncher list is a set of light and dark Unsplash photos, downloaded once a day; the same pair shows all day. The light photo is used with the light theme or by day, the dark one with the dark theme or at night.</string>
    <string name="daily_wallpaper_folders_hint">A different photo each day from your own folders, no internet needed. Light photos are used with the light theme or by day, dark ones with the dark theme or at night. Only photos directly in the folder count. If one folder is empty, the other is used. Turn the daily wallpaper on in Settings.</string>
